# The channel on the C# target, headless: a probe app Start.open serves, driven by
# tools/selftest-channel-cs.mjs. Builds the .csproj and runs `dotnet build`; the selftest launches it.
# Uses -cp src (not -lib heaps-drive) so it never depends on which checkout haxelib points at.
-cp src
-cp tests-cs
-lib haxeui-core
-lib haxeui-cs
-D haxeui_cs_headless
-D haxeui_cs_drive
-D drive
-main ChannelProbe
-cs bin/probe
-w -WAll
